  "label": "Shiba Inu Meme Format",
  "description": "The use of a Shiba Inu dog as a visual anchor in internet memes, particularly the 'doge' meme format, is a cultural phenomenon. This format is often used to present absurd or ironic statements, but in this case, it is weaponized to trivialize or normalize hateful content. The meme format itself is not visible in the image but is essential to understanding how the message is delivered and perceived.",
